WEBVTT

00:06:29.251 --> 00:06:32.962
Many of these seizures and forfeitures
involve just everyday people

00:06:32.986 --> 00:06:34.376
like Russ Caswell

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.555
or you

00:06:35.579 --> 00:06:36.729
or me.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.953
But it gets worse.

00:06:39.743 --> 00:06:40.995
Are you wondering:

00:06:41.019 --> 00:06:44.035
Where does all this cash
and property end up?

00:06:45.515 --> 00:06:48.228
In most places, law enforcement keeps it.

00:06:48.769 --> 00:06:51.616
And they use it to buy equipment

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.102
or pay for building repairs

00:06:54.126 --> 00:06:56.912
or even pay salaries and overtime.

00:06:58.028 --> 00:07:00.494
This is a clear conflict of interest.